$WW,1$$FG,14$$TX+CX,"WorldSim"$$FG$

$TX+CX,"Hermes agent worlds"$

A tile planet where five named agents explore, gather resources, and
write their discoveries into an event log.

$FG,10$Controls$FG$
  $FG,11$Space$FG$       - Pause / resume
  $FG,11$R$FG$           - Grow a new world
  $FG,11$Tab$FG$         - Select the next agent
  $FG,11$1 - 5$FG$       - Select an agent directly
  $FG,11$Arrows$FG$      - Nudge the selected agent
  $FG,11$+ / -$FG$       - Faster / slower ticks
  $FG,11$Esc$FG$         - Quit

$FG,10$The world$FG$
Terrain is generated from overlapping land masses.  Blue is ocean,
green is plain, bright green is forest, brown is hill, light gray is
mountain, and yellow is the city.  Small yellow marks are resources.

Agents seek nearby resources, spend energy while moving, and recover
at the city.  New resources appear from time to time.

$FG,10$Art$FG$
The header uses $FG,11$Hermes/Art/Icons/32/worldsim$FG$ in the
standard sixteen-color temple palette.
